    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/lucky-3-hotel_2/hotel/hanoi-vn.html",
    "name": "Lucky 3 Hotel & Travel",
    "detail": "For a stop over of a few days a very good choice. Fast Wifi, and comfortable environment with a great view from the breakfast restaurant on the 9th floor. The rooms are a good size for one person but for a couple suggest upgrading from the standard roomt to get lots more room and a window ( with a limited view) . As with all narrow buildings in Hanoi the internal rooms do not have windows to the outside but a cunning room design has allowed for external ventilation and a window opening to an airway between each room. he staff are keen to help and most have good to acceptable English language skills. Located on a busy street in the Old Quarter ... access to good shopping and street food stalls and restaurants. Would I stay there again .... certainly. ",
